9,"sd":null},{"k":"26:140","t":"And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":140,"sd":null},{"k":"26:141","t":"Thamūd denied the messengers","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":141,"sd":null},{"k":"26:142","t":"When their brother Ṣāliḥ said to them, \"Will you not fear Allāh?","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":142,"sd":null},{"k":"26:143","t":"Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":143,"sd":null},{"k":"26:144","t":"So fear Allāh and obey me.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":144,"sd":null},{"k":"26:145","t":"And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":145,"sd":null},{"k":"26:146","t":"Will you be left in what is here, secure [from death],","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":146,"sd":null},{"k":"26:147","t":"Within gardens and springs","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":147,"sd":null},{"k":"26:148","t":"And fields of crops and palm trees with softened fruit?","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":148,"sd":null},{"k":"26:149","t":"And you carve out of the mountains, homes, with skill.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":149,"sd":null},{"k":"26:150","t":"So fear Allāh and obey me.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":150,"sd":null},{"k":"26:151","t":"And do not obey the order of the transgressors,","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":151,"sd":null},{"k":"26:152","t":"Who cause corruption in the land and do not amend.\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":152,"sd":null},{"k":"26:153","t":"They said, \"You are only of those affected by magic.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":153,"sd":null},{"k":"26:154","t":"You are but a man like ourselves, so bring a sign, if you should be of the truthful.\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":154,"sd":null},{"k":"26:155","t":"He said, \"This is a she-camel. For her is a [time of] drink, and for you is a [time of] drink, [each] on a known day.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":155,"sd":null},{"k":"26:156","t":"And do not touch her with harm, lest you be seized by the punishment of a terrible day.\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":156,"sd":null},{"k":"26:157","t":"But they hamstrung her and so became regretful.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":157,"sd":null},{"k":"26:158","t":"And the punishment seized them. Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":158,"sd":null},{"k":"26:159","t":"And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":159,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":38,"surahs":[26],"sajdah":false}